<<effects>>

촉수들이 어둠 속으로 물러난다. <<tearful>> 당신은 좀 더 밝은 터널에 이를 때까지 달린다.

<br><br>
<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>
<<mine_links>>



:: Mine Slime
<<effects>>

<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<molested>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<set $combat to 1>>

	<<set $enemytype to "swarm">>

	<<swarminit "slimes" "slime mass" "moving towards you" "encircle you" "fend off" 4 2>>
